   <preamble eId="pbl_1">
      <formula name="actingEntity">
         <p>
            <t v="THE EU-KOREA COMMITTEE ON TRADE AND SUSTAINABLE DEVELOPMENT,"/>
         </p>
      </formula>
      <citations>
         <unit eId="pbl_1/cit_1" kind="citation">
            <p>
               <t v="Having regard to the Free Trade Agreement between the European Union and its Member States, of the one part, and the Republic of Korea, of the other part, ("/>
               <quote startQuote="‘" endQuote="’">
                  <t v="the Agreement"/>
               </quote>
               <t v=") and in particular Article 13.15(3) thereof,"/>
            </p>
         </unit>
      </citations>
      <recitals>
         <intro>
            <p>
               <t v="Whereas:"/>
            </p>
         </intro>
         <unit eId="pbl_1/rct_1" kind="recital">
            <num>
               <t v="(1)"/>
            </num>
            <p>
               <t v="Pursuant to Article 13.15(3) of the Agreement, the Parties are to establish a list of at least 15 persons willing and able to serve as panellists with regard to matters arising under Chapter 13 on Trade and Sustainable Development and who have expertise in the issues covered by that Chapter. Of those individuals, at least five are to be non-nationals of either Party and are to serve as chair of the Panel of Experts."/>
            </p>
         </unit>
         <unit eId="pbl_1/rct_2" kind="recital">
            <num>
               <t v="(2)"/>
            </num>
            <p>
               <t v="On "/>
               <date asWritten="27 June 2012" date="2012-06-27"/>
               <t v=", the EU-Korea Committee on Trade and Sustainable Development adopted Decision No 2/2012"/>
               <noteRef href="#note_1" marker="1"/>
               <t v=" establishing a list of 18 experts that may serve as panellists."/>
            </p>
         </unit>
         <unit eId="pbl_1/rct_3" kind="recital">
            <num>
               <t v="(3)"/>
            </num>
            <p>
               <t v="The Republic of Korea expressed its wish to replace some of the Korean nationals on the list of experts. In order for this amendment to take effect, the revised list of experts should be approved by the EU-Korea Committee on Trade and Sustainable Development."/>
            </p>
         </unit>
         <unit eId="pbl_1/rct_4" kind="recital">
            <num>
               <t v="(4)"/>
            </num>
            <p>
               <t v="Therefore, the Parties have revised the list of experts established by Decision No 2/2012 and the revised list of experts, as set out in the Annex, should be adopted,"/>
            </p>
         </unit>
      </recitals>
      <formula name="enactingFormula">
         <p>
            <t v="HAS DECIDED AS FOLLOWS:"/>
         </p>
      </formula>
   </preamble>
   <body>
      <unit eId="art_1" kind="article">
         <num>
            <t v="Article 1"/>
         </num>
         <p>
            <t v="The list of experts that may serve as panellists for the purposes of Article 13.15 of the Agreement, which is set out in the Annex to Decision No 2/2012, is replaced by the list of experts set out in the Annex to this Decision."/>
         </p>
      </unit>
      <unit eId="art_2" kind="article">
         <num>
            <t v="Article 2"/>
         </num>
         <p>
            <t v="This Decision takes effect on the date of its adoption."/>
         </p>
      </unit>
   </body>
